#: transportmanager.cpp:601
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The following mail transports store their passwords in an unencrypted "
"configuration file.\n"
"For security reasons, please consider migrating these passwords to KWallet, "
"the KDE Wallet management tool,\n"
"which stores sensitive data for you in a strongly encrypted file.\n"
"Do you want to migrate your passwords to KWallet?"
msgstr "Sljedeći načini prijenosa pošte spremaju lozinke u nešifriranu konfiguracijsku datoteku.\nZbog sigurnosti razmotrite premještanje tih lozinki u KWallet, KDE-ov alat za upravljanje novčanikom,\nkoji osjetljive podatke pohranjuje u snažno šifriranoj datoteci.\nŽelite li premjestiti lozinke u KWallet?"

